table="0" parent="ed34"><mxGeometry x="-0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="em36" value="1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;fontSize=9;fontColor=#8FA3BF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ed34"><mxGeometry x="0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_np" value="&lt;b style='color:#FBBF24;font-size:13px;'&gt;LEARNING RULES&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0D1730;strokeColor=#FBBF24;strokeWidth=1;opacity=70;arcSize=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="720" width="1880" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5_n" value="UNIQUENESS — three compound uniques: {student_id, course_id} on enrollments · {quiz_id, student_id, attempt_no} on quiz_results · {student_id, course_id} on ratings &amp; certificates.&#10;&#10;PROGRESS — typed embedded doc, single writer (progress service): $addToSet for completed lessons/chapters · $inc for watch.total_seconds · quiz_scores = best/latest derived from quiz_results.&#10;CONTINUE LEARNING — {student_id, progress.last_accessed_at desc} index serves the dashboard resume card without touching courses.&#10;COMPLETION — final lesson → enrollment.status=completed + certificate issued + notification queued + course stats.completion_count $inc — one transaction, idempotent by unique keys.&#10;RATINGS — 1..5, one per student per course; create/edit/delete atomically adjust courses.stats.rating_sum + rating_count. Moderation hides (status=hidden) — never deletes.&#10;CERTIFICATES — serial {UQ} verifiable without a scan (public GET /api/certificates/verify/:serial); PDF path stored, never the blob." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#101B36;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#AFC0D8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="770" width="1820" height="270" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
</diagram>
