 connectable="0" parent="ed3y"><mxGeometry x="-0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="em40" value="1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;fontSize=9;fontColor=#8FA3BF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ed3y"><mxGeometry x="0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p6_np" value="&lt;b style='color:#FB923C;font-size:13px;'&gt;MONEY RULES&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0D1730;strokeColor=#FB923C;strokeWidth=1;opacity=70;arcSize=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="700" width="920" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6_n" value="ALL money fields are integer *_cents — no floats anywhere.&#10;amount.total_cents is computed SERVER-side (course price +&#10;coupon claim) — client input can never set an amount.&#10;provider_refs.* unique sparse -&gt; one payment per Stripe intent.&#10;status: created -&gt; requires_action -&gt; processing -&gt; succeeded&#10;  -&gt; refunded | partially_refunded | disputed.&#10;refunds[] append-only + refunded_total_cents; money immutable&#10;after succeeded except refund fields.&#10;SNAPSHOT — coupon {code,type,value} copied onto the payment at&#10;purchase: historical truth, not a join dependency.&#10;payment_events = append-only webhook/domain timeline;&#10;provider_event_id {UQ} is the idempotency key; keep 7y (DP-15)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#101B36;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#AFC0D8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="750" width="860" height="270" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6_tp" value="&lt;b style='color:#22D3EE;font-size:13px;'&gt;TRANSACTIONS &amp; WEBHOOKS&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0D1730;strokeColor=#22D3EE;strokeWidth=1;opacity=70;arcSize=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="700" width="940" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6_t" value="PURCHASE TRANSACTION (one Mongo session):&#10;  1. coupon claim findOneAndUpdate (used_count guard)&#10;  2. payment create (status=created, server total)&#10;  3. Stripe checkout session -&gt; id stored on the payment&#10;WEBHOOK succeeded (raw body, signature verified):&#10;  1. payment_events insert {provider_event_id} — idempotent&#10;  2. payment -&gt; succeeded (+ breakdown snapshot)&#10;  3. enrollment upsert {student, course} unique&#10;  4. coupon_redemptions insert {coupon, user} unique&#10;  5. $inc courses.stats.enrollment_count + stats_daily event&#10;  6. chat participant insert + notification queued&#10;PAYOUT — aggregate period -&gt; payout doc + payments.updateMany&#10;  ({payout_id:null} in period) in one transaction." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#101B36;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#AFC0D8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1030" y="750" width="880" height="270" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
</diagram>
