;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;fontSize=9;fontColor=#8FA3BF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ed4g"><mxGeometry x="-0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="em4i" value="1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;fontSize=9;fontColor=#8FA3BF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ed4g"><mxGeometry x="0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed4j" value="campaign_id" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.25;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;fontSize=9;fontColor=#C4D2E6;labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;verticalAlign=middle;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p7u_notifications" target="p7u_notification_campaigns"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="em4k" value="0..*" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;fontSize=9;fontColor=#8FA3BF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ed4j"><mxGeometry x="-0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="em4l" value="0..1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;fontSize=9;fontColor=#8FA3BF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ed4j"><mxGeometry x="0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed4m" value="admin_id" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.25;startArrow=none;endArrow=none;fontSize=9;fontColor=#C4D2E6;labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;verticalAlign=middle;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p7u_notification_campaigns" target="p7st_admin"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="em4n" value="0..*" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;fontSize=9;fontColor=#8FA3BF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ed4m"><mxGeometry x="-0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="em4o" value="1" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];labelBackgroundColor=#0B132B;fontSize=9;fontColor=#8FA3BF;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="ed4m"><mxGeometry x="0.62" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p7_np" value="&lt;b style='color:#A78BFA;font-size:13px;'&gt;UNREAD &amp; MESSAGE WRITE PATH&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0D1730;strokeColor=#A78BFA;strokeWidth=1;opacity=70;arcSize=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="560" width="920" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7_n" value="UNREAD IS MAINTAINED, never computed on read (defect #2 fix):&#10;on message create (one write path):&#10;  1. chat_messages insert (sender, body, attachments[])&#10;  2. chat_rooms.last_message set (denormalized room list)&#10;  3. chat_participants.updateMany({room_id, user_id != sender},&#10;     {$inc: {unread_count: 1}})&#10;  4. io.to(room).emit(message:new) + badge event&#10;on mark-read: unread_count=0 + last_read_at + last_read_id.&#10;&#10;PAGINATION — cursor {room_id, _id desc}; ObjectId ordering&#10;replaces createdAt columns; no skip/limit scans.&#10;PRIVATE ROOMS — participants_key (sorted ids) unique prevents&#10;duplicates; course rooms unique by course_id (sparse).&#10;DELETE — soft (deleted_at); files live in media storage only.&#10;SOCKET AUTH — JWT at handshake; membership check per join." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#101B36;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#AFC0D8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="610" width="860" height="350" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7_cp" value="&lt;b style='color:#22D3EE;font-size:13px;'&gt;CAMPAIGN FAN-OUT &amp; DELIVERY&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0D1730;strokeColor=#22D3EE;strokeWidth=1;opacity=70;arcSize=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="560" width="940" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7_c" value="IN-APP DELIVERY — per-channel status embedded on each doc:&#10;  channels.in_app.delivered_at&#10;  channels.email.{status, sent_at, error}&#10;read model: {user_id, is_read, createdAt desc} {IX}&#10;TTL expires_at keeps the inbox bounded (DP-13).&#10;&#10;CAMPAIGNS — admin composes: audience {all|role|course},&#10;channels in_app/email; Bull repeatable job polls&#10;{status, scheduled_at} -&gt; sending -&gt; fan-out:&#10;  notifications.insertMany(recipients)&#10;  + Bull email jobs per recipient (deduped)&#10;  -&gt; stats.{recipients, delivered, failed}&#10;&#10;METRICS — read/unread per campaign read from notifications&#10;via {campaign_id, is_read} — no title matching (defect #5).&#10;&#10;Every module creates inbox items through one helper:&#10;notificationService.notify(userIds, type, title, ref)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#101B36;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=8;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#AFC0D8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1030" y="610" width="880" height="350" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
</diagram>
